1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,744
Alex: Imagine you spend months doing everything right so Google's A I will cite your website at the top of the search page.

2
00:00:08,319 --> 00:00:11,975
Maya: And then one morning, you check the search results, and there it is.

3
