7
00:00:25,748 --> 00:00:29,310
Maya: Researchers just checked forty days of Google A I Overviews.

8
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:37,147
Maya: And they found that about one in nine claims could not be backed up by the very web pages Google linked to.

9
00:00:37,642 --> 00:00:50,803
Alex: Today we talk about why getting cited by A I is not the same as getting quoted right, where the real bottleneck moves when A I does the work, and why Fisher's bots are never allowed to press send.

10
