Alex: Elon Musk's Roadster and Starlink and political posts, Donald Trump endorsement posts, Yann LeCun's political reposts and Roadster physics breakdown, levelsio's travel notes from Brazil and Krakow, Justin Sun's crypto token burn, a flood of posts about DeepSeek version four point one Flash going live, promotions for HyperFrames and vibecodeapp, marketing pitches about a piano app making seven hundred thousand dollars a month or Claude copying any app, A I movie trailers, model training papers, a course post, free weekend promos, follower celebration posts, and workplace rants.

