Maya: That leaves us with thirteen clean items today, including one borderline item at the end.

28
00:03:00,323 --> 00:03:02,921
Alex: Here's what's coming today. One.

29
00:03:02,921 --> 00:03:14,059
Alex: Why Google's A I Overviews sometimes say things their own linked sources don't support, and how an internet run by A I agents reshapes websites and travel pages.

30
